ة متدينة ومحافظة، تتعارض قيمها بشدة مع مُثُل شيرين. ومع محاولة العائلتين التعايش، تتصاعد التوترات. فالاختلافات في المعتقدات والتوقعات والتقاليد تولّد دراما مستمرة. وتبدأ الأسرار وصراعات النفوذ والاضطرابات العاطفية بالتكشّف، لتضع الولاءات والحب ومتانة الروابط العائلية على المحك. إنها قصة عن الحب وصدام الثقافات وصراع الأجيال، وإلى أي مدى قد يذهب المرء لحماية عائلته ومبادئه.","description_en":"When free-spirited Doğa falls head over heels for charming Fatih, nobody expects the chaos that follows. His family is deeply conservative and devout; hers is modern and secular — and neither side is ready to back down. What starts as a love story quickly becomes a collision of two very different Turkeys, played out through family dinners, in-law battles and everything in between. Sharp, relatable and impossible to stop watching.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77JSE7rHSCkQBlNoi4hPgyzWiRu.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a4FHdQfPGT1T2w4DYUEGgRMxSgZ.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.7,"vote_count":20,"age_rating":null,"year":"2022","release_date":"2022-10-28","runtime_minutes":140,"status":"Returning Series","country":"تركيا","language":"التركية","genres":["عائلي","دراما","رومانسي"],"genre_keys":["family","drama","romance"],"similar":["tv111453","tv16413","tv306215","tv209891","tv39314","tv281761","tv274556","tv302063"],"director":"Melis Civelek","cast":[{"name":"Evrim Alasya","character":"Kıvılcım Arslan","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q3DS5KwZ0vtxZxtQiM0pAIMgKjm.jpg"},{"name":"Barış Kılıç","character":"Ömer Ünal","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2V4rYLRwEdUJkuHSW232TAJaqb5.jpg"},{"name":"Erkan Avcı","character":"Asil Yıldırım","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2SQBu38Hx4Yx2PM7OdKgbdz5UCd.jpg"},{"name":"Özge Borak","character":"Salkım Ünal","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aivPbbK9Eo16DUY785hroy5aFTU.jpg"},{"name":"Seray Kaya","character":"Başak Haksever Ünal","profile_